attribution: Music by Louis Silvers (died 1954), words by B. G. "Buddy" DeSylva (died 1950); introduced by Al Jolson in "Bombo" and published by Jerome H. Remick & Co. in 1921. Public domain: published before 1931 (United States) and all authors died before 1972 (Canada).
